# A date is represented by three components, namely the year, the
# month of year, and the day of month. The following operations are
# accessing those components of a date. Furthermore, there is an
# operation for accessing the day of week of a date. The date is
# indicated by the placeholder {this}, which must not be translated
# and which may be filled by any expression of type
# com.ibm.odm.time.SimpleDate such as "the birthday of the
# customer". This results in expressions such as "the day of week of
# the birthday of the customer".

