# The following operation determines whether two time periods start and
# end at the same instants of time. These time periods are indicated by
# the placeholders {this} and {0}, which must not be translated and
# which may be filled by any expression of type
# com.ibm.ia.TimePeriod. This results into expressions such as "the
# meeting period is during the same time as the period of 2 hours after
# June 6, 2015 12:00:00 PM".

