com.ibm.ia.TimePeriod.equalSeconds(com.ibm.ia.TimePeriod)#documentation = Checks whether two time periods start and end at the same time.

# The following three operations determine whether a time period is
# after, before, or overlaps with another time period. These time
# periods are indicated by the placeholders {this} and {0}, which must
# not be translated and which may be filled by any expression of type
# com.ibm.ia.TimePeriod. This results into expressions such as "the
# meeting period overlaps with the education session".

